<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Terms &amp; privacy</span>
  </nav>
</div>

<section class="wrap wrap-mid" style="padding-bottom:clamp(60px,8vw,110px)">
  <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
  <h1 style="margin:14px 0 18px">Terms, privacy &amp; cookies</h1>
  <p class="lede">Written to be read. If anything here is unclear, ask us and we will explain it in plain language.</p>

  <div class="stack-32" style="margin-top:44px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--text-dim)">
    <div class="panel" id="terms">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Terms of sale</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>By placing an order you make an offer to buy the goods at the price shown. A contract is formed when we
          confirm the order by email, not when the payment is authorised. If a product is mispriced or has sold out
          we may decline the order and refund you in full.</p>
        <p>All prices are in <%= store.currency %>. <%= store.taxLabel %> and shipping are calculated at checkout and
          shown before you pay. Nothing is added after you press pay.</p>
        <p>Tea is a natural agricultural product: leaf appearance, aroma intensity and even flavour vary year to
          year and lot to lot. Our tasting notes describe the lot we are currently shipping, and we will always tell
          you if a new harvest differs meaningfully from the previous one.</p>
        <p>We may update these terms; the version in force is the one published when you place your order.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" id="privacy">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Privacy</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p><strong class="gold">What we collect.</strong> To fulfil an order we need your name, email address,
          delivery address and — for the payment — the card details you type into the checkout. We also keep a record
          of what you ordered and the gateway's transaction identifiers.</p>
        <p><strong class="gold">What we do not collect.</strong> We never receive or store your full card number, its
          expiry date or its security code. Those fields are transmitted directly to OTT Pay when you press pay, and
          what comes back to us is only the card brand and the last four digits.</p>
        <p><strong class="gold">Who else sees it.</strong> OTT Pay processes the payment and receives the card data,
          your name, email and billing address, together with a device fingerprint used for fraud screening. Our
          shipping carrier receives your name and delivery address. That is the complete list; we do not sell, rent
          or share personal data with anyone else for marketing.</p>
        <p><strong class="gold">How long we keep it.</strong> Order records are kept for seven years because tax law
          requires it. Newsletter subscriptions are kept until you unsubscribe, which is one click in every email.</p>
        <p><strong class="gold">Your rights.</strong> Ask us for a copy of what we hold about you, ask us to correct
          it, or ask us to delete anything we are not legally required to keep. Email
          <a class="link-underline" href="mailto:privacy@chayuan.test">privacy@chayuan.test</a> and we will respond
          within 30 days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel" id="cookies">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Cookies and local storage</h3>
      <div class="stack-12">
        <p>We use the smallest possible set of cookies:</p>
        <ul class="stack-8" style="padding-left:18px;list-style:disc">
          <li><span class="mono">cy_csrf</span> — a security token that stops another site from submitting forms on
            your behalf. It contains no personal data.</li>
          <li><span class="mono">cy_admin</span> — only set after a staff member signs in to the back office.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your basket is stored in your browser's <span class="mono">localStorage</span>, under the key
          <span class="mono">cy_cart_v1</span>, so that it survives a page reload. It contains product identifiers and
          quantities and nothing else. Clearing your browser data empties it permanently.</p>
        <p>When a payment is submitted, a device-fingerprint script supplied by our fraud-screening provider runs in
          the checkout page. It reports technical characteristics of your browser and device to that provider. It does
          not read your files, your other tabs, or anything you have typed.</p>
        <p>We run no advertising or third-party analytics trackers on this site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:14px">Contact</h3>
      <p>Cha Yuan Tea — <a class="link-underline" href="mailto:hello@chayuan.test">hello@chayuan.test</a>.
        We answer every message within one business day.</p>
    </div>

    <% if (typeof photoCredits !== 'undefined' && photoCredits.length) { %>
      <div class="panel" id="photo-credits">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:10px">Photography credits</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px">
          Product and editorial photographs on this site are openly licensed images used under the terms of
          their licences, which require attribution. Each is listed below with its author and licence; the
          title links to the original file and its full licence text. Replace these with your own photography
          before launch and this list can be removed.
        </p>
        <div class="credits">
          <% photoCredits.forEach(credit => { %>
            <div class="credits-row">
              <span>
                <% if (credit.source) { %>
                  <a href="<%= credit.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><%= credit.title || credit.slot %></a>
                <% } else { %>
                  <%= credit.title || credit.slot %>
                <% } %>
              </span>
              <span><%= credit.author || 'Unknown author' %><% if (credit.via) { %>, via <%= credit.via %><% } %></span>
              <span>
                <% if (credit.licenceUrl) { %>
                  <a href="<%= credit.licenceUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><%= credit.licence %></a>
                <% } else { %>
                  <%= credit.licence %>
                <% } %>
              </span>
            </div>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</section>
